  "scope": "Exact shared Doom 3/RoE browser keyboard/text exports compiled to Wasm with real SDL2 event queue and SDL_KeyboardInit, the actual keymap step used by SDL video initialization. Session/console conditions are fixtures for Escape routing. Covers non-text keys, uppercase identity, text case, case changes before keyup and seven Escape states. Not a browser, full video driver, gameplay mapper or campaign test.",
